  "notes": "Notion/Evernote-like three-pane notes app (EdgeEver). Mostly grayscale with only a green circular + on 'New note' and small colored notebook icons as accents. Note cards show type-specific meta (\"20 nodes · 9 links\", \"8 records · 6 fields\") and hashtag rows in muted gray. The mind map uses monochrome gray curved edges, a dark pill root node and white outlined rounded-rect branch nodes with leaf labels on underlines. Floating circular AI sparkle button bottom-right opens a docked assistant panel (verified live) with chips and a model switcher. Hint pill with kbd chips at bottom-left of canvas."
